436 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (I wanted to build something they would experience as magical. Disney captures magic. You can feel it when you enter the park. Children like magic. I am not talking about magic tricks or black magic. I am talking about experiencing life as if for the first time, being excited, unguarded, and alive. Movie Night had to be about capturing the magic of childhood so that everyone would feel that feeling every time they got together. The magic would make Movie Night feel special.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
