438 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Movie Night has evolved over the years. The grandchildren now range from the 3rd grade to a senior in high school. It has become progressively more difficult to find movies that interest them and are appropriate for everyone. But by adding a hot tub and pool table, everyone can do something that is magical.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [3]
>>
