<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Movie Night is always at 5:30 on Sunday night. The day has changed from time to time, but not often. It always starts with everyone sitting at a very long table \(actually, two tables end to end\). We hold hands and say grace. Then we eat and talk. It is often quite loud, but that is a sign that everyone feels comfortable participating in the conversation. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
447 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (When dinner is over, everyone helps to clean up and then scatters to do whatever they choose. We come together later for dessert.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
